    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286140/extras/8bc8ae8618356e9016fab12ce638d790.avif?t=1734423666\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286140/extras/3313c0dd471e12f5b098ba96af93e00c.avif?t=1734423666\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Providentia Academy is a captivating 2D visual novel that immerses players in a world of mystery, romance, and supernatural intrigue. Set within the prestigious walls of Providentia Academy, players will follow the story of a talented student who unravels the academy's hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players navigate through the story, they'll make choices that shape the protagonist's relationships, influence the plot, and determine the ultimate fate of the academy. With stunning visuals, evocative music, and a compelling narrative, Providentia Academy offers a unique and unforgettable gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is only the first chapter and not the full game. It serves as an introduction to a longer story, although it's still uncertain if we're going to continue this project. This game is a student project created in a period of 9 weeks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Credits:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Made by GEOMS Entertainment</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saku Raitanen -</strong> Product Owner, Design, Narrative</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essi Pirttivaara -</strong> Technology, Scrum Master, Producing &amp; Publishing</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gabriel Nwaoha -</strong> Audio, Implementation, Producing &amp; Publishing</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mairiin Kask -</strong> Art, Business</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oliver Valtonen -</strong> Art, Q&amp;A</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to:<strong> Tero Korpela -</strong> Technology</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
