Technology, Scrum Master, Producing &amp; Publishing</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gabriel Nwaoha -</strong> Audio, Implementation, Producing &amp; Publishing</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mairiin Kask -</strong> Art, Business</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oliver Valtonen -</strong> Art, Q&amp;A</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to:<strong> Tero Korpela -</strong> Technology</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
